简单说 / In short:
- 可以免费用、可以改 / You may use and modify it for free.
- 署名：写清原作者 Miaomiao 和原仓库地址 / Credit the original author (Miaomiao) and link this repository.
- 不准商用：不能拿去卖、不能用在收费的产品或服务里 / NonCommercial: no selling, no use in paid products or services.
- 相同方式共享：改过的版本发给别人或公开时，要用同样的许可，并写清改了什么 / ShareAlike: if you share a modified version, use the same license and say what you changed.
- 自己私下改、自己用，不用分享 / Private changes for your own use don't need to be shared.

作者的心愿（不是许可的硬要求）/ A wish from the author (not a license requirement):
很希望你把改了什么告诉作者：作者能学到东西，也能帮你的版本推一推。
If you make something with it, please tell the author — I'd love to see it and help share your version.
